### ============================================
### VEHICLES - Alle endpoints
### ============================================
### Deze file bevat alle endpoints voor voertuigen.
### Zorg dat je eerst ingelogd bent (auth.rest) om een token te hebben.
### ============================================

### VARIABELEN
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5082
@contentType = application/json

### TOKEN - Vul dit in na login (kopieer uit auth.rest response)
@token = YOUR_TOKEN_HIER
@adminToken = YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HIER

### ============================================
### GET ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### 1. GET MY VEHICLES - Haal alle voertuigen van ingelogde gebruiker op
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..XaLCD3uNspkGOFfkpYj88l6pIBEjKcmUVwZ6T9bD93U
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 2. GET ALL VEHICLES - Haal alle voertuigen op (Admin Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles/all
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 3. GET BY ID - Haal specifiek voertuig op
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ============================================
### POST ENDPOINTS - CREATE
### ============================================

### 4. CREATE VEHICLE - Maak nieuw voertuig aan
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "licensePlate": "AB-12-CD",
  "make": "Volkswagen",
  "model": "Golf",
  "color": "Blauw",
  "year": 2020
}

### 5. CREATE VEHICLE - Alternatief kenteken format
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "licensePlate": "XY-99-ZZ",
  "make": "BMW",
  "model": "3 Series",
  "color": "Zwart",
  "year": 2021
}

### ============================================
### PATCH ENDPOINTS - UPDATE
### ============================================

### 6. UPDATE VEHICLE - Update voertuig (alleen eigen voertuigen)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "color": "Rood",
  "year": 2023
}

### 7. UPDATE VEHICLE - Update kenteken
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "licensePlate": "EF-34-GH"
}

### 8. UPDATE VEHICLE - Update meerdere velden
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "make": "Mercedes",
  "model": "C-Class",
  "color": "Wit",
  "year": 2022
}

### ============================================
### DELETE ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### 9. DELETE VEHICLE - Verwijder voertuig
### Let op: Kan niet verwijderd worden als er actieve reserveringen zijn
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

